      "description": "ST Action's cover disk 28 (issue 44, December 1991), which holds the rolling demo AW.TOS: its image (.st or .stx), or a zip of AW.TOS. Yours to supply - the package carries none of the game's data. A file of your own may take its place: the project pins its hash.",
