    {
      "id": "CM32L_CONTROL.ROM",
      "display": "Roland CM-32L control ROM",
      "description": "CM32L_CONTROL.ROM: no file of the game's: the Roland CM-32L's control ROM, v1.02, for the MT-32 sound effects (the mt32 setting). Yours to supply - the package carries none of it. Another control ROM Munt knows (the CM-32L's v1.00, an MT-32's) may take its place, the project pinning its hash; an MT-32 lacks the CM-32L's extra effect sounds some of rawgl's notes are for.",
      "size": 65536,
      "sha1": "A439FBB390DA38CADA95A7CBB1D6CA199CD66EF8",
      "name": "CM32L_CONTROL.ROM",
